OL,3,GNEWSAPayment warning after #37k builder
OL,4,A'nightmare'                            
OL,6,F"It's been the worst experience of our 
OL,7,Flives," says Georgina. "Through two    
OL,8,Fpregnancies I had to deal with the     
OL,9,Ffallout from this."                    
OL,11,FConsumers paying for expensive home    
OL,12,Fimprovement projects are often advised 
OL,13,Fto check quotes, credentials, contracts
OL,14,Fand reviews before handing over money. 
